%%{init: {'theme': 'default'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Client as Manager
    participant API  as FastAPI
    participant AUTH as Auth
    participant OS   as OrderService
    participant IS   as InvoiceService
    participant CE   as ComplianceEngine
    participant PS   as PaymentService
    participant DB   as Database
    participant WS   as WebSocket

    Note over Client, AUTH: Step 1 - Login
    Client ->> API  : POST /auth/login
    API    ->> DB   : Lookup user
    DB     -->> API : User record
    API    -->> Client : 200 OK - JWT token

    Note over Client, DB: Step 2 - Create Order
    Client ->> API  : POST /orders
    API    ->> AUTH : Validate JWT
    AUTH   -->> API : OK - role: manager
    API    ->> OS   : create_order(items)
    OS     ->> DB   : Insert order + line items
    OS     ->> DB   : Update product stock
    DB     -->> OS  : order_id created
    OS     -->> API : Order created
    API    -->> Client : 201 Created

    Note over Client, DB: Step 3 - Confirm and Invoice
    Client ->> API  : PATCH /orders/confirm
    API    ->> OS   : confirm_order()
    OS     ->> IS   : generate_invoice()
    IS     ->> DB   : Insert invoice

    alt amount over 500000
        IS  ->> CE  : check_compliance()
        CE  -->> IS : hold = true
        IS  ->> DB  : Set compliance_hold
        API -->> Client : Invoice pending approval
    else amount under 500000
        IS  -->> OS : Invoice issued
        API -->> Client : 200 OK - Invoice issued
    end

    Note over Client, WS: Step 4 - Record Payment
    Client ->> API  : POST /payments
    API    ->> PS   : record_payment()
    PS     ->> DB   : Insert payment + mark invoice paid
    DB     -->> PS  : Payment saved
    PS     -->> API : Confirmed
    API    ->> WS   : Broadcast KPI update
    WS    -->> Client : Dashboard refresh
    API    -->> Client : 201 Created - receipt
